285
00:17:32,120 --> 00:17:33,560 
- Lalu…
- Kau juga, Yin Zhenru.

286
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:35,040 
Pesan apa pun yang kau mau.

287
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:37,040 
Ya.

288
00:17:58,560 --> 00:18:00,600 
Sang Sang, apakah kau tahu
tadi Fu Zhengchu…

289
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:03,720 
