293
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:10,200 
Mulai kelasnya.

294
00:18:10,280 --> 00:18:11,160 
Berdiri!

295
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:16,000 
- Selamat pagi, Pak.
- Selamat pagi, Pak.

296
