DENGAN SANG ZHI LAGI

386
00:25:53,280 --> 00:25:54,200 
Iblis Kecil!

387
00:25:54,800 --> 00:25:56,040 
Kenapa tidak menutup pintu?

388
00:26:03,520 --> 00:26:04,360 
Iblis Kecil!

389
00:26:06,120 --> 00:26:07,920 
Ibu menyuruhku menjemputmu pergi makan!

390
00:26:10,800 --> 00:26:11,680 
Iblis Kecil!

391
00:26:15,520 --> 00:26:16,360 
Iblis Kecil!

392
00:26:19,320 --> 00:26:20,200 
Iblis Kecil!

393
00:26:22,520 --> 00:26:23,720 
Apakah di kamarku?

394
00:26:24,360 --> 00:26:25,240 
Iblis Kecil!

395
00:26:29,280 --> 00:26:30,120 
Iblis Kecil!

396
00:26:31,080 --> 00:26:32,000 
Di mana dia?

397
00:26:49,440 --> 00:26:50,800 
Kenapa tidak menjawabku?

398
00:26:50,880 --> 00:26:51,960 
Mencoba menakutiku?

399
00:26:53,280 --> 00:26:54,680 
Kenapa aku harus menjawabmu?

400
00:26:56,680 --> 00:26:57,600 
Berikan.

401
00:26:58,280 --> 00:26:59,240 
Kembalikan.

402
00:27:00,240 --> 00:27:02,000 
Aku mau pergi makan <i>hot pot</i>, mau ikut?

403
00:27:02,080 --> 00:27:03,280 
Tidak mau.

404
00:27:03,360 --> 00:27:04,440 
Lantas, mau makan apa?

405
00:27:10,000 --> 00:27:10,880 
Tebak.

406
00:27:11,440 --> 00:27:12,280 
Iblis Kecil.

407
00:27:12,880 --> 00:27:15,520 
Saat aku seumuranmu,
ketika Ayah dan Ibu tidak ada di rumah,

408
00:27:15,600 --> 00:27:18,200 
selain harus memasak untukku sendiri,
aku masih harus memasak bagianmu.

409
00:27:18,680 --> 00:27:20,040 
Itu tidak sama.

410
00:27:20,120 --> 00:27:21,120 
Bagaimana tidak?

411
00:27:21,720 --> 00:27:24,080 
Karena saat itu, kau tidak punya kakak,

412
00:27:24,960 --> 00:27:26,960 
tapi aku punya kakak.

413
00:27:28,800 --> 00:27:30,160 
Jangan gunakan trik ini.

414
00:27:30,680 --> 00:27:31,680 
Berikan padaku.

415
00:27:32,560 --> 00:27:33,400 
Halo.

416
00:27:34,040 --> 00:27:35,080 
Kau tidak di asrama?

417
00:27:36,080 --> 00:27:36,920 
Ya.

418
00:27:37,480 --> 00:27:38,960 
Kujemput di tempat kerjamu saja.

419
00:27:40,160 --> 00:27:41,240 
Setengah jam.

420
00:27:41,320 --> 00:27:43,320 
Tenang saja, aku tidak akan melupakanmu.

421
00:27:44,480 --> 00:27:45,360 
Sampai jumpa.

422
00:27:46,360 --> 00:27:48,840 
Kakak, siapa yang pergi makan bersamamu?

423
00:27:48,920 --> 00:27:50,160 
Jangan ikut campur.

424
00:27:50,240 --> 00:27:52,080 
Mengajakmu makan pun aku harus memohon.

425
00:27:52,160 --> 00:27:53,600 
Jika tidak mau, aku pergi. Dah.

426
00:27:55,880 --> 00:27:56,720 
Halo, Ibu.

427
00:27:57,480 --> 00:27:58,600 
Jangan gunakan trik ini.

428
00:28:00,080 --> 00:28:01,360 
Halo, Ayah.

429
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:02,920 
Keterlaluan.

430
00:28:05,360 --> 00:28:06,640 
Aku sudah salah!

431
00:28:08,120 --> 00:28:10,680 
Bukankah begini baru benar?

432
00:28:10,760 --> 00:28:11,880 
Benar, 'kan?

433
00:28:12,680 --> 00:28:15,200 
Bagus begini sejak awal.
Kau sengaja menjahiliku.

434
00:28:15,280 --> 00:28:18,280 
Asal tahu saja, jika kau patuh,
akan kuajak bersenang-senang.

435
00:28:18,360 --> 00:28:19,360 
Ayo.

436
00:28:20,760 --> 00:28:21,760 
Aku dandan sebentar.

437
00:28:21,840 --> 00:28:22,800 
Dua menit.

438
00:28:26,120 --> 00:28:27,080 
Tiga menit.

439
00:28:29,080 --> 00:28:30,320 
Baik, 30 menit, pergilah.

440
00:28:34,000 --> 00:28:35,320 
Bantu aku mengambil ponsel

441
00:28:35,800 --> 00:28:36,720 
di dalam benteng.

442
00:28:38,320 --> 00:28:39,960 
Sudah besar masih bermain benteng?

443
00:28:41,080 --> 00:28:42,080 
Aku coba sebentar.

444
00:28:59,200 --> 00:29:00,920 
Iblis Kecil, kenapa kau begitu diam?

445
00:29:01,880 --> 00:29:03,080 
Sang Zhi.

446
00:29:03,160 --> 00:29:04,240 
Kau senang bertemu aku?

447
00:29:07,880 --> 00:29:08,800 
Aku juga senang.

448
00:29:09,440 --> 00:29:10,320 
Jangan membual.

449
00:29:10,400 --> 00:29:11,440 
Mau makan apa?

450
00:29:11,960 --> 00:29:13,480 
Bukankah makan <i>hot pot</i> di mal?

451
00:29:13,560 --> 00:29:14,960 
Kenapa? Kemahalan?

452
00:29:16,000 --> 00:29:17,680 
Kau pikir aku peduli harganya?

453
00:29:18,840 --> 00:29:19,960 
Kau selalu merasa mahal.

454
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:22,240 
Kapan aku begitu?

455
00:29:23,200 --> 00:29:26,480 
<i>Ternyata teman sekamar
yang dijemputnya adalah Qian Fei.</i>

456
00:29:32,960 --> 00:29:34,080 
Guguk Duan!

457
00:29:34,160 --> 00:29:35,120 
- Bangun!
- Duan Jiaxu!

458
00:29:37,280 --> 00:29:38,680 
Cepat! Sang Yan mentraktir!

459
00:29:40,120 --> 00:29:41,400 
Katamu sepuluh menit?

460
00:29:42,640 --> 00:29:43,960 
Jalanan macet.

461
00:29:44,040 --> 00:29:46,120 
- Lihat jam berapa?
- Katanya lapar? Cepatlah.

462
00:29:46,200 --> 00:29:47,720 
Kenapa kau begitu mengantuk?

463
00:29:49,720 --> 00:29:50,720 
Kau menyandariku lagi.

464
00:29:58,920 --> 00:29:59,920 
Kau begitu mengantuk.

465
00:30:00,920 --> 00:30:02,480 
Kau cari uang atau korban nyawa?

466
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:05,840 
Cepatlah, aku hampir mati kelaparan.

467
00:30:07,600 --> 00:30:09,640 
<i>Dia begitu lelah bekerja,</i>

468
00:30:09,720 --> 00:30:11,360 
<i>aku masih sering menyusahkannya.</i>

469
00:30:11,440 --> 00:30:12,720 
Tidak, aku seharusnya kurus.

470
00:30:13,200 --> 00:30:14,560 
Kapan kau pernah kurus?

471
00:30:14,640 --> 00:30:16,480 
Aku sudah menimbang, beratku turun.

472
00:30:16,560 --> 00:30:18,520 
Kau dari tadi di sini,
tapi tidak menyapaku?

473
00:30:22,880 --> 00:30:23,880 
Apa kabar?

474
00:30:23,960 --> 00:30:25,080 
Apanya?

475
00:30:27,400 --> 00:30:28,520 
Hanya kabarmu.

476
00:30:30,640 --> 00:30:31,560 
"Kau sangat tampan"?

477
00:30:38,440 --> 00:30:39,600 
Di mana yang tampan?

478
00:30:41,120 --> 00:30:42,000 
Bukan aku?

479
00:30:42,760 --> 00:30:45,120 
Jika begitu, kenapa begitu melihatku
wajahmu memerah?

480
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:47,360 
Apakah kau tidak malu?

481
00:30:47,440 --> 00:30:49,000 
Kau selalu begitu.

482
00:30:49,080 --> 00:30:50,080 
Sang Yan,

483
00:30:50,160 --> 00:30:52,480 
apakah kau ingat
pemeriksaan kesehatan sebelumnya?

484
00:30:52,560 --> 00:30:55,760 
Aku terengah-engah setelah berlari,
